---
// Reveal fixture: footer sits below a 2,200px spacer, off-screen on load.
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" /><title>Reveal fixture</title>
    <style>body{margin:0;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}.spacer{height:2200px}</style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1 data-payload-field="heroTitle" data-testid="hero">Top</h1>
    <div class="spacer">scroll down for the footer</div>
    <p data-payload-field="footer" data-testid="footer">old footer</p>
  </body>
</html>
